{
  "_doc": "Tier-2 logging camp at the west end of the logging road (region D6). One two-storey camp house (cookhouse, the dingle passage, bunkhouse; cook's quarters, stores loft, crew loft and the foreman's room upstairs) and a single-storey office and tool crib by the gate (flat roof), in an equipment yard. Route: the yard -> the office is locked -> the cookhouse front is barricaded -> round the back, the kitchen door sticks -> the cook at her range; taking the office keys off the pantry nail wakes the cookhouse group -> office: the drying-room key and Brody's ledger; records room: the safe key on the iron ring (the clerk sleeps there) -> the dingle: the padlocked drying-room door (a can chime across it) -> drying room -> bunkroom (loose boards in the aisle wake the quarantined in their bunks) -> up to the crew loft -> the foreman's room (loot; Walt guards it) -> back down and out the bolted side door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
